  "version": 3,
  "generated": "read out of Art/fieldGuidePlateRig.js at its defaults, with the defs’ words, by export/catch-review/tools/plate.js — regenerate, never hand-edit",
  "purpose": "the field guide plate: one knowledge page per species with a def, drawn on the notebook kit. The def’s words on the ruled leaf, the species from the catch rigs on the squared leaf, at a page scale of its own that the plate states with a bar.",
